{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "31", "x": 0.907881431531324, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.025861817072311773, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "someone comes up to us and says that is is he or she who owns the ait that we", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.8065716547414766, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "breathe in and just like that forces us to pay for over lives. This would not be", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.8068328883237713, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "acceptable to any human and they would be taking measures against.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.7117269477511305, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Just like that our earth was created with all the water it had even before humans", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.8071377975363869, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "came into existence hence proving us that no person or no government is the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.8068108454587033, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sole protector of the earth's water resources.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.46475053679502687, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Water was created for the dwellers of soil and creatures of the sea and all", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.8071565596029332, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mankind to utilize. The creator of it did not ask us to pay for it by any means of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.806919726959644, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "money then who are we to charge for such a basic thing which we do not even", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.8068980941943912, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "own?", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.05869999588874935, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "We all have seen countries going to work claiming the ownership of the water", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.80734940904104, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "resources and if one of them does win all the effort goes down to nothing when", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.807094121906066, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the end they tax their own countrymen for it.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.480473199823288, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It is there that access to clean water is a basic human right. Therefore, every", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.8076358637619707, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "home should as water supply is free. It is the responsibility of the authorities to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.8071198556694711, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "look after the needs of the people as it them who declared clean water as a basic", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.8070940193811122, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "right.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.05890155994792963, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[ Examiner's comments]", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6342418354686408, "w": 0.2555179699074907, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Here is the examiner's comment:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.662609303393009, "w": 0.33792801476933476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This is a good response that provides relevant ideas. The writer expresses their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6909396534671467, "w": 0.8265274962186234, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "position, and agrees with the statement that access to clean water should be free,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7192700035412843, "w": 0.8263599704441064, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "although there is some repetition and some lack of clarity within the main ideas", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.747600429058207, "w": 0.8261207797268797, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "expressed.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7759307791323447, "w": 0.11634964925700679, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There are supporting arguments that include: whether any kind of water, or only", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8042611292064822, "w": 0.8265251381446859, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "'clean water' should be provided, whether people should be allowed to 'own' the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8324431587652672, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "air we breathe and force people to pay for it, whether any person should be the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8607982540728919, "w": 0.8261208822518334, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[sole protector] of the water supply and whether the aim is to [tax their own", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8891286795898146, "w": 0.8266933815938796, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "countrymen] for water. The conclusion states that governments have declared", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9174590296639522, "w": 0.7992093121775141, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}